menu "Web Server / WiFi"

    config WEB_SERVER_MDNS_HOSTNAME
        string "mDNS hostname"
        default "cyd-logger"
        help
            Device answers at http://<hostname>.local on the LAN once
            connected.

            WiFi network credentials are not configured here — they're
            provisioned at runtime (SoftAP + captive portal on first boot
            or whenever the stored network can't be reached; see
            components/web_server/wifi_provision.c) and stored in NVS on
            the device, never in this build.

endmenu
